{"authored" [{"question" "q-76059" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $B=\\overset{―}{A}$, where $A=[\\begin{aligned}7-\\text{i} & 6+4\\text{i} \\\\ 7-4\\text{i} & 4+9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].$ What is the value of ${b}_{12}-{b}_{21}?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "f75fa7cdcdcaf8a30bc68e7d98624270f380046bf1008cc40fbe38213070be5d" "basis" 1667 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{A} & =\\overset{―}{[\\begin{aligned}7-\\text{i} & 6+4\\text{i} \\\\ 7-4\\text{i} & 4+9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{7-\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{6+4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{―}{7-4\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{4+9\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7+\\text{i} & 6-4\\text{i} \\\\ 7+4\\text{i} & 4-9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{12}-{b}_{21}=(6-4\\text{i})-(7+4\\text{i})=-1-8\\text{i}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/state.json" "file_sha256" "f75fa7cdcdcaf8a30bc68e7d98624270f380046bf1008cc40fbe38213070be5d" "basis" 1667 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045065/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37ba5df55475007f46a653df2e9ada705233f87b3c21410d3cbcfaa3ff4acf79"