 "file_sha256" "5a274246d52f520fddc7ecf4f3e9e3ba6705721a24b41e8b687ff9461311e76d" "basis" 2509 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-140381" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & -2-4\\text{i} \\\\ 3-2\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{1+2\\text{i}}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 3-2\\text{i} & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(2\\text{i}-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 6-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 6-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/state.json" "file_sha256" "5a274246d52f520fddc7ecf4f3e9e3ba6705721a24b41e8b687ff9461311e76d" "basis" 2509 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-140381" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d3f16b3f0ecf8d5873283e7befb470a63cdb8b0e929f123a22619c642147266d" "basis" 2509 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-140381" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070700/state.json" "file_sha256" "5a274246d52