bute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{A} & =\\overset{―}{[\\begin{aligned}7-\\text{i} & 6+4\\text{i} \\\\ 7-4\\text{i} & 4+9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{7-\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{6+4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{―}{7-4\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{4+9\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7+\\text{i} & 6-4\\text{i} \\\\ 7+4\\text{i} & 4-9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{12}-{b}_{21}=(6-4\\text{i})-(7+4\\text{i})=-1-8\\text{i}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ee2e4aa80a8e4569657e0274d7fc95c1b443428f57c803da7a2e4b5c70568e11"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-1-8\\text{i}"] ["math" "1+8\\text{i}"] ["math" "11+5\\text{i}"] ["math" "13"] ["math" "14-58\\text{i}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76059" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-1-8\\text{i}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-132713" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $B=\\overset{―}{A}$, where\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3-2\\text{i} & 4\\text{i} \\\\ -1-3\\text{i} & 5 & 3-5\\text{i} \\\\ 2+\\text{i} & -5-\\text{i} & -3+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].$ What is the value of ${b}_{31}+{b}_{32}?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-132713" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the complex conjugate of each entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{A} & =\\overset{―}{[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3-2\\text{i} & 4\\text{i} \\\\ -1-3\\text{i} & 5 & 3-5\\text{i} \\\\ 2+\\text{i} & -5-\\text{i} & -3+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{-4} & \\overset{―}{3-2\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{―}{-1-3\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{5} & \\overset{―}{3-5\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{―}{2+\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{-5-\\text{i}} & \\overset{―}{-3+3\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3+2\\text{i} & -4\\text{i} \\\\ -1+3\\text{i} & 5 & 3+5\\text{i} \\\\ 2-\\text{i} & -5+\\text{i} & -3-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${b}_{31}+{b}_{32}=(2-\\text{i})+(-5+\\text{i})=-3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-132713" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/quest