n matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1-7\\text{i} & 2-4\\text{i} \\\\ 6\\text{i} & -5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1-7\\text{i} & 2-4\\text{i} \\\\ 0+6\\text{i} & -5+0\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -5\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{Im}(A)=[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-140323" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ee2e4aa80a8e4569657e0274d7fc95c1b443428f57c803da7a2e4b5c70568e11"} {"question" "q-140323" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-140323" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & -5\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 5\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-140323" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76203" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $\\,\\text{Re}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\text{Im}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}e & f \\\\ g & h\\end{aligned}]\\,$ are the real and imaginary parts of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}-3\\text{i} & 5\\text{i} \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\,$ then what is the value of $ah-cf?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76203" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "For the given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}-3\\text{i} & 5\\text{i} \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0-3\\text{i} & 0+5\\text{i} \\\\ -4+0\\text{i} & 5+0\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $a=0,c=-4,f=5$ and $h=0.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nah-cf=0\\cdot 0-(-4)\\cdot 5=20.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/state.json" "file_sha256" "488a5fcd32697263736065519ffe28b83cae16c0c77629ba70f812e1b52c6458"} {"question" "q-76203" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/activity-metadata.json" "f